          "alias": "常规色彩tag｜原版自然语言",
          "prompt": "she is dressed in an elegant pure white frilled bikini. her legs stretched out behind her as she gracefully dives and swims forward through the water,and the sunlight shine through the water and reflects mottled ripple-patterned light on her body. the artwork is a breathtaking masterpiece of underwater photography viewed from a low angle. the view is close to the girl,with one foot out of frame,so the details of her body and face can be seen. dazzling,volumetric god rays from the sun violently pierce the ocean surface,creating spectacular water caustics that dance across her skin and the rugged rocky seabed. realistic air bubbles trail behind her movement. masterful lighting and hyper-realistic water refraction.",
